    "notes": [
      "Depends on the landed Phase 41 browser bridge settings, diagnostics, and recovery overlay.",
      "This final overlay requires the complete configured Devtool restore, build, test, XPI package, artifact verification, and lint matrix and forbids deferred validation.",
      "Dark and AMOLED XPIs are checked for exact inventory, fixed timestamps, stable identity, minimal permissions, generated theme and scheme contracts, distinct hashes, and release-artifacts.json metadata.",
      "The consolidated validator replays Phases 37 through 41 and scans for browser runtime reintroduction, route drift, uppercase MIME declarations, static Android references, and raw secret signatures.",
      "Legacy UIX R2 and R5 validators are updated for the shared Phase 40 theme-token architecture, and browser bridge diagnostics render stable human-readable labels instead of enum names.",
      "Android resolver automation and the manual IronFox 152+ matrix remain physical-device release evidence after the code gate lands.",
      "No top-level route, Android browser runtime, Room migration, transfer-engine behavior, app version, or custom-scheme credential payload is introduced."
    ]
